Without commenting on whether or not it makes good sense to wish
for a cursed magic marker, here is my list of scrolls that you might
potentially want to be cursed:

confuse monster (confuses self)
create monster (create many monsters for sacrifice / XP)
destroy armor (rustproof armor)
earth (create a single boulder -- useful if the others will get 
       in the way, for example, in Sokoban)
enchant armor (reduce enchantment for another chance to get to +5)
enchant weapon (ditto)
fire (does less damage, but still burns away slime)
food detection (detect potions*)
genocide (creates several of a given monster)
gold detection (detects traps)
scare monster (unscare monsters near you -- possibly useful as a knight...)
teleportation (level teleport)

[*] I never knew this until looking at the spoiler just now.

Note that some of the other scrolls can also be used while
cursed with a good effect, but that effect isn't harmed by
having them uncursed, so I didn't include them in the list.
Some of the other bad scrolls could debatably be put to use,
but they're even more of a stretch than 'scare monster.'  Also,
although a couple of these can be duplicated or have a
similar effect while uncursed if you're confused, as some people
have noted it's sometimes more convenient not to have to confuse
yourself.

